==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|умъ||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|умъ}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*umъ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-ум.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|b|aug=уми́ще|pej=уми́шко}}

# [[mind]]
#: {{coi|ru|[[в своём уме́]]|in one's senses, in one's right mind}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[не в своём уме́]]|not right in the head, out of one's sense}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[взя́ться]] [[за]] '''ум'''|clean up one's act}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[прийти́]] [[на]] '''ум'''|to [[occur]], to [[cross]] [[one]]'s [[mind]]}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[своди́ть]]/[[свести́]] [[с]] '''ума́'''|to [[drive crazy]]}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''уму́''' [[непостижи́мо]]|}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[у]] [[он|него́]] '''ум''' [[за]] [[ра́зум]] [[зайти|зашёл]]|he went crazy}}
# [[intellect]]
# [[cleverness]], [[brains]], [[wit]]
# [[reason]]

